Z||000014||Oreif||01-09-2001||09:56 AM||||Got the pic. Was there a metal sleeve inside the center of the bushings when you installed them? Looks like that or the missing washer is what is causing the problem. <BR>I copied your pic to a .jpg so it can be posted. I also used your pic (hope you don't mind) to show how mine looked prior to torquing the long bolt.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Up_cntrl_a.jpg"> ||||reg||1
